  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 5.8% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $14.86B (5.8% lower over 30D) hints that tokenized asset growth paused or reversed\u2014more consistent with risk-off allocation or redemptions than a pure news cycle. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/12/standard-chartered-offers-rlusd-custody-in-dubai-and-plans-lmax-collateral-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Standard Chartered offers RLUSD custody in Dubai and plans LMAX collateral link</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/ondo-opens-trading-in-openai-linked-private-market-note\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ondo Opens Trading in OpenAI-Linked Private-Market Note</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Institutional commitments are still a leading share signal:</strong> Bank and asset-manager distribution deals often shift platform and network leadership before headline RWA totals fully catch up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/12/south-korea-just-got-its-first-traditional-bank-loans-backed-by-bitcoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">South Korea just got its first traditional bank loans backed by bitcoin</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxOOUpJNUtDZ2ZVQjlTQzBvVTBIU2Q4YURxcnJnNDZXRnppd2QwMU8zaUNRM00zbGZDUHc1OXBpOU1DeklSeVlhbk5lX202S3U2NXlmY2x5dHRuLVFlUXBfU0dadW96YXpOMF9vNDhDWms5SS1mVGpBQWVOeDNSeS13SlN5Y0JHODAtQjVFcTdqTnpleTRvZHFIZU04YTZTaEludlVBQkx6Sk1SRDdjTWswSDdsamw2VUtCUlhHa1lzRngtVkU?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tokenized U.S. equities offer off-hours access but carry liquidity and stability risks, IMF says</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
